        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, so we're finally at the part where the actual jailbreak happens.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "It feels like we skipped over some details, but this sounds a lot more complicated than I imagined.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haghhh... I'm getting a bit sleepy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_242_mayer#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, me too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_242_mayer#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about I make everyone some coffee~?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_108_silent_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're almost to the end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_108_silent_1#4",
        "name2": "char_249_muesys_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I know, I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_108_silent_1#4",
        "name2": "char_249_muesys_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But I already have a pretty good idea of what happened after that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_108_silent_1#4",
        "name2": "char_249_muesys_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "All the groundwork was laid, so they just had to wait for the day of the actual breakout.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "But on the day of the jailbreak, someone was missing, am I right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_108_silent_1#4",
        "name2": "char_249_muesys_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_108_silent_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the end, they decided they would escape during cleaning duty at C-Zone, while the prison is docked at Nulaiteburgh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Robin didn't show up at the appointed time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all, they didn't know that Jesselton, the puppetmaster here, already knew all about their plans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for Robin, she was waiting for them up ahead...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
